  "notes": "\n1. Used the '政府資料開放平臺' table as the primary source for YouBike station data.\n2. Filtered stations to keep only those within a 800m straight-line radius of Da'an Station (25.0330, 121.5436) using prep.within_radius.\n3. Applied prep.merge_same_place to ensure each physical location is represented by a single station entry, merging stations with the same name and close coordinates.\n4. Dropped rows with missing essential data (coordinates, IDs, or names).\n5. Generated a pairwise distance matrix using prep.haversine_matrix based on the filtered station coordinates.\n6. Created a mock 'positions' set as a sequence of integers from 0 to N-1 to satisfy the TSP model requirements.\n",
